pathname: component:image-block-quoted-base
title: 画像ブロックベース(引用)
source: https://scp-jp.wikidot.com/component:image-block-quoted-base
-----
> [[div class="scp-image-block block-{$align} scp-clear-{$clear}" style="width:{$width}; margin-top: 1.2em;"]]
> [[image {$name} style="width:{$width};" link={$link}]]
> [[div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:{$width};"]]
> {$caption}
> [[/div]]
> [[/div]]\
